  "body": "## [2.39.6](https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/compare/n8n@2.39.5...n8n@2.39.6) (2026-09-16)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **core:** Check Gateway credits eligibility against the correct sub-node ([#38673](https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/issues/38673)) ([0cf7e99](https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/commit/0cf7e992d0c70797b608db78bc71684ab184b530))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **core:** Add v3 breaking change rule for the storage directory rename ([#38636](https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/issues/38636)) ([c3dcbbe](https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/commit/c3dcbbef454a49a75a5dd54f6b54be8422d57c88))\n* **core:** Warn on deprecated N8N_DB_PING_TIMEOUT env var ([#38569](https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/issues/38569)) ([ab03087](https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/commit/ab030877b4113628b996c3b2678c7cb331328ccf))\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a href=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/n8n-io/n8n/pull/38772?utm_source=github\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Review in cubic\" src=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\n",
